 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you too. How are you? That's easy to forget. Would you rather ask yourself whether your tent has inner or outer poles, before you head out, or in the middle of the dark trying to set it back up? Okay, sure. Which way do you prefer? A quick check before you leave, then act on it before you leave. Stick it in your check list so it sticks in your head. Then embed the action in a key part of your tent packing routine. Put the poles together in the bag so they' easy to find.",
